      "reason": "Expired and future-timestamp, unknown-currency, malformed, and ambiguous-address listings were filtered. The browser blocked excess precision, overflow, and unsupported-currency submissions; unsafe image URLs were not linked or fetched, and injected markup remained literal text."
    },
    {
      "case": "G06-05",
